 "```lean\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ ⊤ ⊑\n    wp\n      (forIn l 0 fun x __s =>\n        have acc := __s;\n        have acc := acc + x;\n        pure (ForInStep.yield acc))\n      (fun a =>\n        binderNameHint a\n          (fun __s =>\n            have acc := __s;\n            pure acc)\n          (wp\n            (have acc := a;\n            pure acc)\n            (fun r => r = l.sum) PUnit.unit))\n      PUnit.unit\n```",
