 "```lean\ncase vc3\nn : Nat\na✝¹ : ⌜True⌝\nb✝ : Nat\nmb✝ : (Variant.ofMeasure fun i => i).γ\na✝ :\n  (Variant.ofMeasure fun i => i).EvalsTo b✝ mb✝ ⊓\n    match false, b✝ with\n    | false, a => (fun x => ⌜True⌝) a\n    | true, a => (fun x => ⌜True⌝) a ⊓ (fun r => ⌜r = 0⌝) a\nh✝ : ¬0 < b✝\n⊢ b✝ = 0\n```",
